answerEvaluation.prompt:
Evaluate the user's answer to the control question.

Topic: ${dynamicLearningState.currentTopic.title}
Aspect: ${currentStep.title}
Question: ${currentStep.question}
User's answer: ${userAnswer}
User's idea: ${ideaData}
Attempt: ${dynamicLearningState.currentAspectAttempts}/${dynamicLearningState.maxAttemptsPerAspect}

Evaluate the answer on a scale of 1-10, where:
1-3: Incomplete or incorrect answer
4-6: Partially correct answer
7-10: Complete and correct answer

If the answer is complete (score 7-10), move to the next aspect.
If the answer is incomplete (score 1-6) and this is not the last attempt, ask one guiding question related to the user's idea.
If this is the last attempt, move to the next aspect.

IMPORTANT: Limit your response to maximum 2000 characters.

Response format:
SCORE: [number from 1 to 10]
COMMENT: [brief comment]
ACTION: [NEXT_ASPECT or GUIDING_QUESTION]
[if GUIDING_QUESTION, add the question itself]

